ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENT:
=======================================================================

Any public use, redistribution, or derivative work using this database MUST
include the following attribution:

  "Tribunal decision data collected, parsed, and annotated by 3mpwrApp
   (https://3mpwrapp.ca). Licensed under ODbL 1.0."

=======================================================================
SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE:
=======================================================================

This license applies to the following databases contained in this repository:
  - data/tribunal-decisions/ (Ontario tribunal decisions, 134,000+ records)
  - data/wsiat/ (WSIAT case data)
  - data/ (all structured data files)

The tribunal decisions themselves (court/tribunal rulings) are in the public
domain as government records. This license covers:
  - The SELECTION of decisions included in this database
  - The ARRANGEMENT and organization of decisions
  - The PARSING, TAGGING, and ANNOTATION of decisions
  - The METADATA and derived analytical fields
  - The SCRAPING SCRIPTS and processing logic (also covered by AGPL-3.0)

